# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — clang -O2 消除不可观察分配 → hook/分配器测试失败 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-11
# Software: gperftools 1.6 (perftools-1.6)
# Gate: PR 【知识库扩展】feat(gperftools) — R03 返工（hook 类 5 项 + system_alloc 转绿）
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-clang-o2-unobservable-alloc
software:               gperftools
version:                perftools-1.6
trigger_tool:           clang-15
phase:                  testing|compilation
error_signature:        Check failed: g_NewHook_calls > 0|
                         Check failed: a.invoked_|
                         heap 文件栈为空（@ 后无地址）|
                         单跑 hook 正常但批量测试 hook 计数 0
severity:               2
category:               toolchain, optimization, testing
match_keywords:         -fno-builtin, unobservable allocation,
                         allocator elision, new/delete 配对消除,
                         g_NewHook_calls, operator new, hook 未触发,
                         clang -O2, AM_CXXFLAGS, system_alloc
root_cause:             clang -O2 对"不可观察分配"（new 结果仅传 delete[]、
                         从不被使用）做消除优化，operator new/delete 配对被
                         整体删除 → tc_newarray/tc_new 不调用 → MallocHook
                         与自定义系统分配器回调不触发 → 断言失败
solution:               测试/构建配置 AM_CXXFLAGS 补全全局 -fno-builtin
                         （或让测试观察分配指针）；最小复现 hookelim 验证
                         -O2 计数 0 → 加 -fno-builtin 后恢复 1
affected_scope:         使用 hook/分配器回调断言"分配确实发生"的测试
verification_cmd:       最小复现：不观察 new char[100] 的 hook 计数，
                         -O2=0、-O2 -fno-builtin=1
similar_to:             E293 (C++17 兼容, 不同主题), E026 (TLS, 不同主题)
caused_by:              OHOS clang-15 -O2 allocator elision 优化
prerequisite_of:        tcmalloc hook 类测试转绿
conflicts_with:         none
